#
# Cloudflare dashboard (önerilen, kod dışı):
# Scrape Shield → Email Address Obfuscation = Off
# Speed → Optimization → Rocket Loader = Off
#
# CACHE — kritik:
# Cloudflare Pages, eksik /_astro/* dosyasına 404.html basar ve _headers
# kurallarını O 404 yanıtına da uygular. "immutable, 1 yıl" bir deploy
# yarışında oluşan 404'ü bir yıllığına zehirler (login JS kırılması).
# Bu yüzden /_astro için immutable KULLANMIYORUZ.
#
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://accounts.google.com https://apis.google.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://accounts.google.com; img-src 'self' data: https://*.googleusercontent.com https://*.licdn.com https://media.licdn.com; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://accounts.google.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; frame-src https://accounts.google.com; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self' https://www.linkedin.com
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, stale-while-revalidate=86400

/404.html
  Cache-Control: no-store
